{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "Vibh. 18 (PTS 1904 [1978]: 404, 21)"}
{"id": null, "n": "0016008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0016008", "type": "mod", "text": "底本之 asambhinnavatthukā 即是未滅之事。（註書四〇四頁）（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁對應之註標[04]與章節校注內容不符，故今將此處的[04]註標修訂成[08]註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0057003", "type": "mod", "text": "在底本無……pe……。而暹羅本有。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107026", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0107026", "type": "mod", "text": "底本之 yani 即是 ayaṁ。（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁中缺相對應之註標[26]，今於此處加上[26]之註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 uppañña 即是 uppnna。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005002", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 atītārammana 乃是 ārammaṇā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005003", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 paccupaññā 則是 paccupannā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0006004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0006004", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 upekhāsahagata 即是 sahagatā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0008005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0008005", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之……pe……者，暹羅本無。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0008006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0008006", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 paccupannā 乃是 paccupannārammaṇā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0012007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0012007", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 sattasattari 則是 sattasattati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0016008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0016008", "type": "orig", "text": "[04]"}
{"id": null, "n": "0017009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0017009", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 pañcaññaṁ 乃是 pañcannaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0019010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0019010", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 samantarā 則是 samanantarā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0020011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0020011", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 maggesu 即是 phalesu。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0021012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0021012", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 vicaravippayuttā 乃是 vicāravippayutta。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0023013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0023013", "type": "orig", "text": "kammassakat 則是自業之慧。四種之項下參閱。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0025014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0025014", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 catusu bhūmīsu 即是 catūsu maggesu。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0026015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0026015", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺 catusu bhūmisu vipāke。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0031016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0031016", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺 nibbedhabhāgini。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0032017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0032017", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 akāsānañcayatanassa 乃是 ākāsa。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0033018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0033018", "type": "orig", "text": "此之苦則是 kasira 之譯語。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0033019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0033019", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 dandhābhiññā 即是 khappabhinnā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0034020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0034020", "type": "orig", "text": "底本脫落。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0036021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0036021", "type": "orig", "text": "nirāmiso 即謂無欲之資糧，無輪迴之資糧，無世間之資糧。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0036022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0036022", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 sasaṁkhāraniggayhavāritavato 者為 na saṁkhāraniggayhavāritagato。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0036023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0036023", "type": "orig", "text": "作種種神變為神通智。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0039024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0039024", "type": "orig", "text": "kañci saṁkhāraṁ 者依其慣用譯為諸行。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0040025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0040025", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺 sakkattaṁ kareyya mārattaṁ kareyya。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0041026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0041026", "type": "orig", "text": "此處之「因緣」者即以 nidāna 之譯語使用之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0042027", "type": "orig", "text": "幸趣（gatisampattī）者即 sampannā gati 為天界與人界。又，不幸趣（gativipattī）者即與前者相反為四種之惡趣。（註四三九頁參閱）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0049028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0049028", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 bhāyaduccaritena 乃是 kāya。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0057001", "type": "orig", "text": "生憍即是 jātimada 之譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0057002", "type": "orig", "text": "種憍即是 gottamada 之譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0057003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0057003", "type": "orig", "text": "在本底無……pe……。而暹羅本有。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0059004", "type": "orig", "text": "底本脫落 senāsana。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0059005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0059005", "type": "orig", "text": "底本脫落 icchati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0060006", "type": "orig", "text": "siṅga 即依透入之義為角。此乃名之為都市性煩惱之角（註四七六頁）。為淫蕩之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0060007", "type": "orig", "text": "panta-senāsana 直譯則可譯為邊際住處、獨閉處。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0065008", "type": "orig", "text": "此處即是 mānaṁ，不記為 omānaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0066009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0066009", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺……pe……。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067010", "type": "orig", "text": "所謂「難作相應之不死尋」者是「作難作之事而死隨之來世即我幸福」。又，成見相應即為捕捉於常見等者之事。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0068011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0068011", "type": "orig", "text": "無間住（aṭṭhapanā）、自性住（thapanā）、再再來住即依註釋為 anantaraṭṭhapanā, pakati-ṭhapanā, punapunaṁ agataṭṭhapanā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0070012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0070012", "type": "orig", "text": "Dovacassayaṁ 之譯語。Daurvacasyam（梵）即於律僧殘法第十三譯為不受如法諫。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0072013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0072013", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺……pe……。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076014", "type": "orig", "text": "底本於欲界及恚界之後填入……pe……。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0080015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0080015", "type": "orig", "text": "於此句之前，應補充一句：「此處，如何為其他之三愛耶？」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0083016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0083016", "type": "orig", "text": "vidhā 之意譯語，為三種之慢。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0085017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0085017", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 adukkhamasukkaṁ 即是 asukhaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0086018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0086018", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 mohokasāvo 乃是 mohakasāvo。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0087019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0087019", "type": "orig", "text": "同於註[07]。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0088020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0088020", "type": "orig", "text": "同於註[12]。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094021", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 āvaṭṭanā 即是 āvajjanā。ānvattanā 乃是 anvajjanā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0097022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0097022", "type": "orig", "text": "silabbata 則是。sīlabbta。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099023", "type": "orig", "text": "agatigamenāni 之譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099024", "type": "orig", "text": "依註書則 vaggagamana = asamaggabhāvena gamanaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099025", "type": "orig", "text": "依註書則 varigamana = vāri viya yatha-ninnaṁ gamanaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107026", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 yani 即是 ayaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0112027", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之……gandhesu 乃是 gandhesu……。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0113028", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 tatra 則是 tatratatra。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0122029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0122029", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 bhanti 即是 bhanati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0132030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0132030", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺 tathā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0154001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0154001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 satindriyāni 即是 satti。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0155002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0155002", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 rupāyatanaṁ 乃是 rūpa。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0170003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0170003", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 tatiyo bhāgo 則是 catuttho bhāgo。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0170004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0170004", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 kappo 即是 eko kappo。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0170005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0170005", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 abhassarānaṁ 乃是 ābhassarānaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0173006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0173006", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 siyā na 的 siyā 可刪除。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175007", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 satindriyā 則是 sattindriyā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175008", "type": "orig", "text": "底本之 siyā anārammaṇaṁ 可取消。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0176009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0176009", "type": "orig", "text": "同上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0177010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0177010", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本缺 viññato。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0177011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0177011", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本為 na viññato。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0182012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0182012", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺 siyā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0183013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0183013", "type": "orig", "text": "底本缺此一句。暹羅本有。"}
